<br><br>
at
<br><br>
Valley Creek Mine No. 2<br>
Tennco Incorporated<br>
Clairfield, Claiborne County, Tennessee<br>
ID No.  40-03231<br><br>

Accident Investigators
<br><br>
Alice Blanton<br>
Coal Mine Safety and Health Inspector
<br><br>
Don McDaniel<br>
Coal Mine Safety and Health Inspector, Electrical
<br><br>
Eugene Hennen<br>
Mechanical Engineer
<br><br>
